{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45213","headline":"陪颜使君饯宣谕萧常侍 · 皎然","name":"陪颜使君饯宣谕萧常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江涛凋瘵後，远使发天都。\n昏垫宸心及，哀矜诏命敷。\n恤民驱急传，访旧枉征舻。\n外镇藩条最，中朝顾问殊。\n文皆正风俗，名共溢寰区。\n已事方怀阙，归期早戒涂。\n繁笳咽水阁，高盖拥云衢。\n暮色生千嶂，秋声入五湖。\n离歌犹宛转，归驭已踟躇。\n今夕庾公意，西楼月亦孤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}